#: ../../source/docs/modules/graph.rst:5 4049743780a648c78bd5e0275eb3c80a
msgid "Graphing Live Data"
msgstr "实时数据图形"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/graph.rst:11 e87f51aa8e804f1ab68dba17a7636080
msgid ""
"A module to plot (graph) data in realtime from the UAV. It is useful for "
"looking for time-varying patterns in the data"
msgstr "从无人机实时绘制（图形化）数据的模块，用于查找数据中随时间变化的规律"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/graph.rst:14 0220a67cc0d5409287a64841bb4d9189
msgid "After loading, new plots can be created by:"
msgstr "加载后，可通过以下方式创建新图表："

#: ../../source/docs/modules/graph.rst:20 8b363c49144a4a0ebbaf3a6ae8d64171
msgid ""
"Multiple items can be added at once. Use the ``:2`` to specify using the "
"right vertical axis."
msgstr "可同时添加多个项目。使用 ``:2`` 指定使用右侧纵轴。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/graph.rst:27 5e1e2c464ffd4ee8b0fc585c66a9f881
msgid "Arbitrary mathematical functions can also be used."
msgstr "也可以使用任意数学函数。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/graph.rst:33 8a4a81affc014be48313e4c26c0ca556
msgid ""
"Additionally, the timespan and tick resolution of the graph window can be "
"changed. Use ``graph timespan X`` to change the timespace to X seconds and "
"``graph tickresolution Y`` to change the tick resolution to Y seconds."
msgstr ""
"此外，可更改图表窗口的时间跨度和刻度分辨率。使用 ``graph timespan X`` 将时间跨度改为 X 秒，``graph "
"tickresolution Y`` 将刻度分辨率改为 Y 秒。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/graph.rst:40 282d60765ac1455d859f5b8f7cdd7c2c
msgid "There are two global settings for graphs: timespan and tickresolution."
msgstr "图表有两个全局设置：timespan（时间跨度）和 tickresolution（刻度分辨率）。"

#: ../../source/docs/modules/graph.rst:42 4c7defd72b4f41a0a2288dd2c0d49812
msgid "To set the timespan along the horizontal axis (in seconds):"
msgstr "设置横轴时间跨度（单位：秒）："

#: ../../source/docs/modules/graph.rst:48 3c684ea4d38e43dd8ace2074038917db
msgid ""
"To set the tickresolution along the horizontal axis (1/<number of ticks>):"
msgstr "设置横轴刻度分辨率（1/刻度数量）："

#: ../../source/docs/modules/graph.rst:54 20e66a5af06447e0b2895cfba1d55135
msgid ""
"To graph a ``NAMED_VALUE_FLOAT`` value that has a name``NAME``, which can be"
" used for freeform data:"
msgstr "绘制名称为 ``NAME`` 的 ``NAMED_VALUE_FLOAT`` 值的图表，可用于自由格式数据："
